<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cexit</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cexit
</pre>
<p>Takes you out of your clan house, past its locked door. Type it in the 
room just inside the clan's door; it works only there, and only for 
members of the clan. To go in, see <a cmd='#'>Help Center</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
